Example files:

test_absorption.cc          check absorption routine in a bar and more directly
test_air_lens.cc
test_barrel1a.cc
test_barrel1.cc
test_barrel2.cc
test_barrel3.cc
test_cylinder.cc
test_disk.cc
test_focus2.cc
test_focus.cc
test_hook.cc
test_lens.cc
test_sheet.cc
test_simple_bar2.cc
test_simple_bar.cc
test_system.cc		         adding of several systems to one optical system.
test_test.cc
test_titti.cc
test_top.cc

test_barrel4.cc			JLAB 2013: check if shape of EV has influence on measured photons.


mppc.cc                     light catcher for a MPPC

prototype.cc                beamtest simulation with prism and (backward) lens options
photTrajectory.cc           debug tool for prototype.cc (visualization of the photon trajectory)
parTrajectory.cc            debug tool for prototype.cc (visualization of the particle trajectory)
parameter.cc                debug tool for prototype.cc (show all used parameters in a ROOT-file)
DetEffi.C/h		              detector efficiency
DetEffi_LinkDef.hh          for creating a ROOT dictionary
KBarAnalysis.C/h            generates the kBar maps (look-up tables); only works as shared library created by make
KBarAnalysis_LinkDef.hh     for creating a ROOT dictionary
run_KBarAnalysis.cc         macro to start the kBar analysis (w/o mcp mode)
mcpPos.cc                   display a single MCP on screen (adjustable) and show the hit pixels
screenPix.cc                pixelization with pixel-tree
recoCherenkovAngle.cc       Cherenkov angle reconstruction from a pixel-tree & kBar-tree
recoCherenkovAngleTrue.cc   Cherenkov angle reconstruction with true kBar-vectors
effiConti.cc                show the separate efficiency contributions for a single prototype simulation & create a new tree
effiContiPlot.cc            plot some efficiencies as a function of a parameter
timeSpec.cc		              pixelization and plot interactively the time distribution for each pixel
